  "notes": "The God Wars Dungeon-variant gem drop table (Template:GWDRDT's own G-pool, computed via Template:CalculateRDTNaked). Reached from gwd_rare_drop_table at weight 20/128 (the same internal RDT-to-gem routing chance as the regular rare_drop_table.json) or directly from a GWD boss page at a fixed 2/127 access rate. Differs from the regular gem_drop_table.json's own item set (Chaos talisman at weight 3 where the regular table has no drop at all) — the page's own prose only claims the rune-sword/coins substitutions, but the raw CalculateRDTNaked params say otherwise and are trusted over the prose summary, matching the rendered dropsline bucket for Kree'arra exactly. The mega-rare pool is unchanged from the regular table (same items, same weights) and is reused directly rather than duplicated. See docs/DECISIONS.md."
